## 1. Modular Directory & Feature Vertical Slice Layout

Enterprise React Native applications organize code by **feature vertical slices**, strictly enforcing layer isolation. Code must never be organized into generic monolithic folders such as `components/`, `screens/`, or `services/`.

```text
